---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import { topics } from '../data/topics';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>

	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<h1>The next era will be built by people still willing to think like beginners.</h1>
				<p class="subhead">
					I write about quantum computing, AI, energy, supply chains, and the institutions that
					hold societies together. The future is uncertain, and alarm is the easier thing to
					sell. I'd rather work out what we can build, and find the people who want to build it
					with me.
				</p>
				<p class="subhead">
					<em>Everything here is a working draft. Help me edit it.</em>
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="doors">
				<h2>The topics I keep returning to</h2>
				<div class="topicList">
					{
						topics.map((t) => (
							<a class="topic" href={`/topics/${t.slug}`}>
								<span class="topicLabel">{t.label}</span>
								<span class="topicDesc">{t.desc}</span>
							</a>
						))
					}
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="stance">
				<h2>What I hold to</h2>
				<p>
					I believe new technology could make this a much better world, and I'm using this site
					to be specific about how. When I write about dangers, and I will, every
					piece ends with a credible path forward.
				</p>
				<p>
					I explain things at the level you're actually asking, define jargon when it earns its
					place, and leave my thinking visibly unfinished where it is unfinished. You'll disagree
					with some of it. Good. <a href="mailto:harry@harrymunroe.com">Email me</a> and say so.
				</p>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />

		<style>
			.hero {
				padding: 2em 0 1em;
			}
			.hero h1 {
				font-size: clamp(2.2em, 6vw, 3.2em);
				margin-bottom: 0.4em;
			}
			.subhead {
				max-width: 60ch;
				font-size: 1.05em;
				color: var(--ink-muted);
			}
			.doors,
			.stance {
				margin-top: 2.5em;
				padding-top: 1.5em;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
			}
			.topicList {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
			}
			.topic {
				display: flex;
				gap: 1em;
				align-items: baseline;
				padding: 0.7em 0;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
				color: var(--ink);
			}
			.topic:last-child {
				border-bottom: none;
			}
			.topic:hover {
				text-decoration: none;
			}
			.topic:hover .topicLabel {
				color: var(--accent-deep);
				text-decoration: underline;
				text-underline-offset: 3px;
			}
			.topicLabel {
				font-weight: 700;
				color: var(--accent);
				min-width: 6.5em;
			}
			.topicDesc {
				color: var(--ink-muted);
				font-size: 0.95em;
			}
			.stance p {
				max-width: 62ch;
			}
			@media (max-width: 600px) {
				.topic {
					flex-direction: column;
					gap: 0.15em;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
